# What an extension's file leaves out is said as soon as its owner answers, as before #303,
# and never waits behind the boards' report (the owner's decision of 2026-11-20). tests/drive.rs
# installs csv-table patched to give, in every file, an item whose role isn't one, and writes
# Ashfall.canvas and Lahar.canvas, each with a card left out. Nothing is kept from csv-table
# yet, so it answers in its own time, and its report comes then.
size 160x44
env COLD_LAVA_EDITOR=none
wait-for example-workspace 35 notes
wait-for 5s csv-table couldn't read Volcanoes/
wait 1500ms
keys q
exits 0
